# Datums (an extension): a tile whose top face and a corner are named
# as datums is linked twice into an empty model beside it. Edit >
# Datums lists the tiles' datums by link, each link by its handle since
# both are called tile. The screen stays while something is selected:
# selecting the first's top there, then the second's, and Assembly >
# Mate Flush lays the tiles' tops in one plane.
file $testdata/datums/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/datums/tile.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
file $testdata/datums/tile.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
menu Edit|Datums...
tw
twmove 276 180
twdown L 276 180
twup L 276 180
tw
twmove 276 250
twdown L 276 250
twup L 276 250
menu Assembly|Mate Flush
menu Edit|Datums...
tw
save
